  "notes": "{返済|へんさい} is used for formal repayment of loans, debts, and borrowed money.\n\nVERBAL USE:\n{返済|へんさい}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to repay, to pay back\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {返済|へんさい}⟦{期間|きかん}→期間：00229_kikan⟧: repayment period\n- {返済|へんさい}⟦{計画|けいかく}→計画：01172_keikaku⟧: repayment plan\n- {返済|へんさい}⟦{能力|のうりょく}→能力：03541_nouryoku⟧: repayment capacity\n- ⟦{早期|そうき}→早期：09568_souki⟧{返済|へんさい}: early repayment\n- ⟦{一括|いっかつ}→一括：08947_ikkatsu⟧{返済|へんさい}: lump-sum repayment\n- ⟦{分割|ぶんかつ}→分割：11745_bunkatsu⟧{返済|へんさい}: installment repayment\n\nRELATED FINANCIAL TERMS:\n- ⟦{融資|ゆうし}→融資：04775_yuushi⟧: financing, loan\n- ⟦{借金|しゃっきん}→借金：03203_shakkin⟧: debt (casual)\n- ⟦{負債|ふさい}→負債：14950_fusai⟧: liabilities (accounting)\n- ⟦ローン→ローン：06579_roon⟧: loan (loanword)\n\nREGISTER: Formal/business vocabulary.",
